inancial analysis</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Equip your CA practice with deterministic valuation, deal feasibility, and financial health modeling.\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.webmanifest\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Vaelo | Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Institutional-grade financial analysis for independent CA practices\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://vaelo.co.in\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Vaelo\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_IN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?a67fca71f9856096\"/><meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Vaelo - Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Vaelo | Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Institutional-grade financial analysis for independent CA practices\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"http://localhost:3000/opengraph-image?a67fca71f9856096\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Vaelo - Institutional-grade financial analysis\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?icon.3iysonzhh3pit.svg\" sizes=\"any\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon?a0d61ffc213ad2ca\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"180x180\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><noscript><style>\n            /* Fallback for users with JS disabled: override framer-motion initial opacity: 0 */\n            div, span, p, h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, section, article {\n              opacity: 1 !important;\n              transform: none !important;\n            }\n          </style></noscript><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col font-sans bg-paper text-ink\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><nav class=\"border-b border-ledger-line bg-paper sticky top-0 z-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between h-16 items-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><a class=\"flex items-center hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-200\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Vaelo\" width=\"120\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/branding/vaelo-logo-lockup.svg\"/></a></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How it works</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-sm text-paper bg-corporate-blue hover:bg-corporate-blue/90 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-sm transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Get Started</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center\"><button class=\"text-slate hover:text-corporate-blue focus:outline-none p-2\" aria-label=\"Toggle mobile menu\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav><div class=\"flex-grow\"><div style=\"opacity:0\"><main><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-paper border-b border-ledger-line\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif text-ink leading-[1.1] tracking-tight\">Institutional-grade financial analysis for your SME clients.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed\">Equip your CA practice with deterministic valuation, deal feasibility, and financial health modeling. Submit client financials and receive a rigorous, client-ready report delivered via WhatsApp or PDF in 24-48 hours.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-sm text-paper bg-corporate-blue hover:bg-corporate-blue/90 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Request a Sample Report</a><a class=\"inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3 border border-ledger-line text-base font-medium rounded-sm text-ink bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-sm transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/how-it-works\">See how it works</a></div></div><div class=\"relative border border-ledger-line bg-white shadow-sm p-1 rounded-sm w-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"border border-ledger-line p-6 bg-paper/50\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-ledger-line\"><h3 class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate font-semibold\">DCF Valuation Preview</h3><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-precision-green bg-precision-green/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm\">LIVE MODEL</span></div><div class=\"space-y-3 font-mono text-sm\"><div class=\"flex justify-between py-2 border-b border-dashed border-ledger-line\"><span class=\"text-slate\">FY24 EBITDA</span><span class=\"text-ink font-medium tabular-nums\"><span>₹0.0 Cr</span></span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between py-2 border-b border-dashed border-ledger-line\"><span class=\"text-slate\">Sector Multiple</span><span class=\"text-ink font-medium tabular-nums\"><span>0.0x</span></span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between py-2 border-b border-dashed border-ledger-line\"><span class=\"text-slate\">WACC (Est.)</span><span class=\"text-ink font-medium tabular-nums\"><span>0.0%</span></span></div><div class=\"flex justify-between pt-4 mt-2\"><span class=\"text-ink font-semibold\">Implied Enterprise Value</span><span class=\"text-corporate-blue font-bold text-lg tabular-nums\"><span>₹0.0 Cr</span></span></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-ledger-line\"><div class=\"w-full bg-slate-100 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-corporate-blue h-full\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate uppercase text-right\">Confidence Interval: High</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white border-b border-ledger-line py-20\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-ink mb-6\">Strategic advice is expected. Producing it shouldn&#x27;t drain your practice.</h2><div class=\"font-sans text-slate text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6\"><p>Your clients are increasingly looking to you for strategic guidance during the moments that matter most—a critical loan application, an approaching acquisition, or negotiating with an investor.</p><p>But producing investment-grade valuation or deal feasibility models manually demands hours of modeling that most small and solo practices simply don&#x27;t have. Enterprise software is built and priced for large corporate finance teams, not independent Chartered Accountants.</p><p class=\"text-ink font-medium\">Vaelo bridges this gap. We provide the heavy quantitative lifting, so you can focus on advising your client with confidence.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-paper py-24 border-b border-ledger-line\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-ink\">How it works</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-slate text-lg\">A straightforward process designed around the working rhythm of a CA practice.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"relative group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-6 left-full w-full h-[1px] bg-ledger-line -ml-4 z-0\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-paper p-2 -m-2 rounded-md transition-all duration-200 group-hover:bg-white group-hover:shadow-sm group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm mb-6 bg-white shadow-sm transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:bg-corporate-blue group-hover:text-white\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">Data Submission</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed\">Submit your client&#x27;s raw financials via a secure portal or email for a specific event—such as a loan application, potential sale, merger, or investor conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-6 left-full w-full h-[1px] bg-ledger-line -ml-4 z-0\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-paper p-2 -m-2 rounded-md transition-all duration-200 group-hover:bg-white group-hover:shadow-sm group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm mb-6 bg-white shadow-sm transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:bg-corporate-blue group-hover:text-white\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">Deterministic Modeling</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed\">Vaelo runs rigorous valuation and feasibility modeling (including DCF, sensitivity analysis, and accretion/dilution). Every output is strictly formula-driven and auditable, never a black box.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-6 left-full w-full h-[1px] bg-ledger-line -ml-4 z-0\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-paper p-2 -m-2 rounded-md transition-all duration-200 group-hover:bg-white group-hover:shadow-sm group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm mb-6 bg-white shadow-sm transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:bg-corporate-blue group-hover:text-white\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">Report Delivery</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed\">Within 24 to 48 hours, you receive a beautifully formatted, client-ready PDF report branded with your firm&#x27;s details, delivered directly via WhatsApp or secure email.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative group cursor-default\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-paper p-2 -m-2 rounded-md transition-all duration-200 group-hover:bg-white group-hover:shadow-sm group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 border-2 border-corporate-blue text-corporate-blue font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm mb-6 bg-white shadow-sm transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:bg-corporate-blue group-hover:text-white\">04</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">Iterative Refinement</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed\">Review the model with your client. If variables change, simply request adjusted assumptions and we will generate an updated report for you immediately.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-24 border-b border-ledger-line\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-16 max-w-2xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-ink\">What you get</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-slate text-lg\">Institutional-grade deliverables, ready to be presented to your clients under your advisory banner.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"border border-ledger-line p-8 flex flex-col h-full hover:border-corporate-blue/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 bg-white\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-ink mb-4\">Valuation Report</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed flex-grow mb-6\">A comprehensive Discounted Cash Flow (DCF) model and comparable company analysis, complete with sensitivity tables. Perfect for M&amp;A, capital raising, or dispute resolution.</p><div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-ledger-line/50 mt-auto\"><span class=\"block text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wide text-slate mb-1\">When to use:</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-ink\">Client seeking investment or negotiating a sale.</span></div></div><div class=\"border border-ledger-line p-8 flex flex-col h-full hover:border-corporate-blue/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 bg-white\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-ink mb-4\">Deal Feasibility Report</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed flex-grow mb-6\">Accretion/dilution analysis, debt capacity modeling, and synergy evaluations. Helps your client understand if a proposed acquisition or merger makes financial sense.</p><div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-ledger-line/50 mt-auto\"><span class=\"block text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wide text-slate mb-1\">When to use:</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-ink\">Client considering an acquisition or structural merger.</span></div></div><div class=\"border border-ledger-line p-8 flex flex-col h-full hover:border-corporate-blue/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 bg-white\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif font-medium text-ink mb-4\">Financial Health Snapshot</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed flex-grow mb-6\">A lightweight, recurring diagnostic that analyzes liquidity, solvency, and working capital cycles to flag potential distress before it becomes terminal.</p><div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-ledger-line/50 mt-auto\"><span class=\"block text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wide text-slate mb-1\">When to use:</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-ink\">Quarterly or annual check-ins with key retainers.</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-paper py-24 border-b border-ledger-line\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-ink\">Why CAs trust Vaelo</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-slate text-lg\">We understand the reality of running a professional practice in India.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">Built for independent practices</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3\">We aren&#x27;t trying to sell enterprise software to corporate CFOs. We built Vaelo exclusively to empower solo and small CA firms with the tools they need to grow their advisory revenue.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">Auditable &amp; Formula-Driven</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3\">You stake your professional reputation on the advice you give. That&#x27;s why every number we produce is fully traceable to standard financial formulas. No black-box AI guesswork.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">DPDP Act-Conscious Privacy</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3\">Client financial data is highly sensitive. Our infrastructure is encrypted at rest and in transit, with strict data isolation per client. We never use your data to train public models.</p><a class=\"text-corporate-blue text-sm font-medium hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-200 relative group inline-flex max-w-max\" href=\"/privacy-policy\"><span>Read our Privacy Policy<!-- --> →</span><span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-[1px] bg-ink transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-full\"></span></a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3\">No New Dashboards</h3><p class=\"text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3\">You don&#x27;t have time to learn another SaaS tool. Reports are delivered directly to you via WhatsApp or secure email. Review it, forward it to your client, and look like a hero.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-corporate-blue text-paper py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif mb-6\">Ready to elevate your advisory practice?</h2><p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Request a sample report today to see the rigor of our analysis firsthand. First-time practices can commission their first client report at a discounted pilot rate.</p><a class=\"inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-sm text-corporate-blue bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 hover:-translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200\" href=\"/contact\">Request a sample report</a><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm font-mono text-blue-200\">No subscription required. Pay per report.</p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div></div><footer class=\"bg-ink text-paper border-t border-ledger-line/20 py-12\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"bg-paper p-1.5 rounded-sm shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-105\"><img alt=\"Vaelo Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-7 h-7\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/branding/vaelo-icon.svg\"/></div><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-90\">Vaelo</span></a><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-xs leading-relaxed\">Institutional-grade financial analysis, purpose-built for independent Chartered Accountants in India.</p></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono\">Platform</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How It Works</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-